:"A37716-zh-00021","doc":"A37716","law_id":"kr-011931-265259-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2753871","source_hash":"69af6061888b88736c45b70f500c88e352b94494b1faebaa323363eef51ec910","text":"确定。"},{"id":"A37716-zh-00022","doc":"A37716","law_id":"kr-011931-265259-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2753872","source_hash":"791f946e82b1e9060b646d673d00d094f825d9e72c7179500f43be60e34eed12","text":"即使你没有担任过正式或全职员工，也可以做志愿者、自由职业者，"},{"id":"A37716-zh-00023","doc":"A37716","law_id":"kr-011931-265259-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2753873","source_hash":"a33d33706c4feaec04b9fe5b9b6e0b5d72c3ab6766f19e6387995323606013d9","text":"如果申请人在拟从事的领域（例如体育活动）有相关活动记录，则需向内政部和安全部门申请。"},{"id":"A37716-zh-00024","doc":"A37716","law_id":"kr-011931-265259-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2753874","source_hash":"aa0bcc7de14c807c647fa89fba69b20c407aa9cd0febcc0dc2aee436614ee024","text":"根据部长的决定，相关时期全部或部分可计入职业生涯。"},{"id":"A37716-zh-00025","doc":"A37716","law_id":"kr-011931-265259-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2753875","source_hash":"86a1c2a464c15dedd6731c95a7bd21a6d5137bd9c5c92d2d973627070388368a","text":"有。"},{"id":"A37716-zh-00026","doc":"A37716","law_id":"kr-011931-265259-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2753876","source_hash":"435d94918702251ce0ec4a3245abb49a9dafeb68ae8d2572baee7537a7a29dc3","text":"3. 对于每个职位组，符合更高职位组申请要求的人员"},{"id":"A37716-zh-00027","doc":"A37716","law_id":"kr-011931-265259-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2753877","source_hash":"63f1780e117082774714f4d76361e3f630ae5ecdfd805021eda8608b8b3d314a","text":"已认定  的资格要求已得到满足。"},{"id":"A37716-zh-00028","doc":"A37716","law_id":"kr-011931-265259-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2753878","source_hash":"2c073fee10d20d7ac2d02ffdf26676d34be1c68c7e0e9cc3796e1c1189ccc516","text":"■ 地方专业职业官员条例 [附件1] <2017年7月26日修订>"},{"id"