5259-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2753887","source_hash":"69d6658a1a7b441c705143983ca1a834448d4eb877a57d429ef054bd0a881922","text":"具有研究经验的人"},{"id":"A37717-zh-00010","doc":"A37717","law_id":"kr-011931-265259-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2753888","source_hash":"29c00876be8b12341610e8cd6ccdb5994eb570c857f2a8981f87fd8422844b39","text":"纳贡"},{"id":"A37717-zh-00011","doc":"A37717","law_id":"kr-011931-265259-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2753889","source_hash":"2c705a5551124c52c70b7e30be6aa694245ca89e9097e66b6d725a56dabb7172","text":"1. 已获得相关领域硕士学位的人员"},{"id":"A37717-zh-00012","doc":"A37717","law_id":"kr-011931-265259-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2753890","source_hash":"51280fcf394621585d9eeeea40a7d2b134bc77758475fc36952fad7661eaeb29","text":"2. 在获得相关领域的学士学位后，从事相关领域的工作至少 2 年，或"},{"id":"A37717-zh-00013","doc":"A37717","law_id":"kr-011931-265259-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2753891","source_hash":"69d6658a1a7b441c705143983ca1a834448d4eb877a57d429ef054bd0a881922","text":"具有研究经验的人"},{"id":"A37717-zh-00014","doc":"A37717","law_id":"kr-011931-265259-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2753892","source_hash":"6f899c22b2de499e39e9e9d54d13f357fe7ea478780ccaeb8bba427fc8bf9c1f","text":"3. 专科院校等相关专业的毕业生，已获得副学士学位且完成学业不超过3年者"},{"id":"A37717-zh-00015","doc":"A37717","law_id":"kr-011931-265259-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2753893","source_hash":"4e806b9ec3b525328684225f4f73d7418c63707f11d1f82d70548bedddba6e52","text":"在相关领域拥有工作或研究经验的人员"},{"id":"A37717-zh-00016","doc":"A37717","law_id":"kr-011931-265259-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2753894","source_hash":"cef805382c71efe9bb33557ab2ac491479cd155e7cf3d30a55c9d222eb881626","text":"多枪"},{"id":"A37717-zh-00017","doc":"A37717","law_id":"kr-011931-265259-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2753895","source_hash":"77e22eab94f633bd6ffc3c972a1cfd7e7bddb90c41b6d21ddc9938a9400dac8e","text":"专科院校等相关专业的毕业生"},{"id":"A37717-zh-00018","doc":"A37717","law_id":"kr-011931-265259-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2753896","source_hash":"a0be5b33dabffdfd85854fdd198a945de10f8238e6c078b287660dc43c44fcd4","text":"※ 备注"},{"id":"A37717-zh-00019","doc":"A37717","law_id":"kr-011931-265259-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2753897","source_hash":"c435c15fb0d2ae5beea9b7d91a48d0902b3ab2f2dabb51c3f2ff38ef9f0e05a7","text":"1. 即使您没有作为正式或全职员工、志愿者、自由职业者工作过，"},{"id":"A37717-zh-00020","doc":"A37717","law_id":"kr-011931-265259-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2753898","source_hash":"1b343a5b5643b225f31917243113ca075e25dc679829693f5cc64bb1d5dd0c47","text":"如果在拟聘职位领域有相关活动记录，例如团队活动、行政管理等，则更佳。"},{"id":"A37717-zh-00021","doc":"A37717","law_id":"kr-011931-265259-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2753899","source_hash":"7a7d5231e1f170a294a1da21180083ca4e056c941053ef9899ddfa44c7b6f6b3","text":"根据安全部长制定的规章，相关期间的全部或部分应计入经验。"},{"id":"A37717-zh-00022","doc":"A37717","law_id":"kr-011931-265259-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2753900","source_hash":"f352742072067a538a50f405686e22f12593b5cc4b4128d2c36fbe2e03c3efcf","text":"可以包含。"},{"id":"A37717-zh-00023","doc":"A37717","law_id":"kr-011931-265259-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2753901","source_hash":"0353c7535368547d137ae567f77fdc9f858b33d0c1b630238bc42b58df4a0bf2","text":"2. 对于每个职位组，符合更高职位组申请要求的人员"},{"id":"A37717-zh-00024","doc":"A37717","law_id":"kr-011931-265259-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2753902","source_hash":"63f1780e117082774714f4d76361e3f630ae5ecdfd805021eda8608b8b3d314a","text":"已认定  的资格要求已得到满足。"},{"id":"A37717-zh-00025","doc":"A37717","law_id":"kr-011931-265259-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2753903","source_hash":"fe51dc119620c628bd2675656b368d59beda2e5888d96e42a882f6b8e5d5d2e5","text":"3。“毕业生等”是指根据《高等教育法》从专科院校毕业的人员及其他人员。"},{"id":"A37717-zh-00026","doc":"A37717","law_id":"kr-011931-265259-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2753904","source_hash":"a8c85c81ed2426d5bdaaa15ea46d1ad08c8c0615e4b48e45941777b4e507d599","text":"它指的是被公认为具有相同或更高教育背景的人。"},{"id":"A37717-zh-00027","doc":"A37717","law_id":"kr-011931-265259-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2753905","source_hash":"f08c303f7fed03a38b6a9cc86bb182fc392eb383a6de339fa7def6bc7be9342a","text":"■ 地方专业职业官员条例 [附件2] <2017年7月26日修订>"}]}